00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.970
Requerimento número 1023 de 2025,

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:18.130
autor deputado Dudu Runalsa,

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.090
requer à mesa na forma regimental

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:24.570
